• How the system, process or part failure can be predicted and how it can be managed? 
• How the part failure can be quickly fixed for a good experience on the user's eyes? 
• Where the product will fail?
• How the product will fail? 
• Who will be there when the product will fail? And, how he/she will manage the fail?
• Is the product still working properly after a part failure? Will the user willing to keep using the product in this condition?